cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as follows."
title: "The Last Yes: A Synthetic Benchmark for Transaction-Authorisation Integrity"
authors:
  - family-names: Plange
    given-names: Justice Edwin Mensah
version: 0.1.9
date-released: 2026-11-08
type: software
abstract: >-
  A synthetic benchmark for evaluating transaction-authorisation integrity
  in tool-using conversational commerce agents. It includes task suites,
  a local simulator, deterministic grading, reference traces, tests, and
  raw model-evaluation reports.
